        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a beautiful, snowy day in the neighborhood. School's cancelled, so it's time for a snowball fight! Play as a group of friends taking up the mantle of defending their homes from imaginary monsters with nothing but snowballs, cocoa, and their wild imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884730/extras/c1da7cd221c8ed3ac48b481b19cbf3d6.avif?t=1756228296\" alt=\"Banner - Tactical Snowball Combat\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich and rewarding tactical experience! Take cover behind the environment to protect yourself, focus fire to stop monsters from regenerating, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884730/extras/00d18327dbe99b3ce57a521f64262d7f.avif?t=1756228296\" alt=\"Banner - War of Imagination\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight, your imagination will begin to run wild. With this power, you can bring imagination to life! Soar through the air, create the ultimate unbreakable anti-everything shield, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884730/extras/8c7d1124435aee844baf271bd5154e76.avif?t=1756228296\" alt=\"Banner - Grow Into Heroes\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose three new powers to add to your team! There's no wrong answers, so let your imagination run wild as you prepare to face the endless hordes of snow monsters!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a beautiful, snowy day in the neighborhood. School's cancelled, so it's time for a snowball fight! Play as a group of friends taking up the mantle of defending their homes from imaginary monsters with nothing but snowballs, cocoa, and their wild imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884730/extras/c1da7cd221c8ed3ac48b481b19cbf3d6.avif?t=1756228296\" alt=\"Banner - Tactical Snowball Combat\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich and rewarding tactical experience! Take cover behind the environment to protect yourself, focus fire to stop monsters from regenerating, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884730/extras/00d18327dbe99b3ce57a521f64262d7f.avif?t=1756228296\" alt=\"Banner - War of Imagination\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight, your imagination will begin to run wild. With this power, you can bring imagination to life! Soar through the air, create the ultimate unbreakable anti-everything shield, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884730/extras/8c7d1124435aee844baf271bd5154e76.avif?t=1756228296\" alt=\"Banner - Grow Into Heroes\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose three new powers to add to your team! There's no wrong answers, so let your imagination run wild as you prepare to face the endless hordes of snow monsters!</p>",
